    "author": "[Marvin M2, SidraAdil]",
    "comments": [
      {
        "content": "Molecular Adverse Outcome Pathway for [AOP 257](https://identifiers.org/aop/257), \"Receptor mediated endocytosis and lysosomal overload leading to kidney toxicity\". Key Event nodes and the relationships between them are from AOP-Wiki RDF 97191db (2026-08-01); the green pathway nodes are the molecular pathways mapped to each Key Event and approved in the molAOP Builder (snapshot 2026-08-13).",
